=== Test 1: LOCAL vs GLOBAL struct ===
Global before: gPt.x= 50 gPt.y= 75
In sub (global): p.x= 50 p.y= 75
Global after:  gPt.x= 999 gPt.y= 888

Local before: pt.x= 50 pt.y= 75
In sub (local): p.x= 50 p.y= 75
Local after:  pt.x= 999 pt.y= 888

=== Test 2: LOCAL vs GLOBAL integer array ===
Global arr: 0= 0 1= 10 2= 20 3= 30
In sub (global): 0= 0 1= 10 2= 20 3= 30

Local arr: 0= 0 1= 10 2= 20 3= 30
In sub (local): 0= 0 1= 10 2= 20 3= 30

